WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
At the edge of the world, the light still remembers the way home.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.500
She follows the wind into a wasteland no one has reached.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Every breath measures the gaps that time left behind.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Memory is a tide; the shore only appears when it retreats.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Some leave so they never have to look back.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
And some lights wait only for you.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
When night falls, the answer is up ahead.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.000
This is our moment.
